<title>JAPAN: Towa slips on margin-expiry related trade.</title>
<headline>Towa slips on margin-expiry related trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Towa Real Estate Development Co Ltd slipped due to margin-expiry related trade on Thursday morning, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0130 GMT, the share price was down 17 yen at 308 yen, the fifth largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
